# Decaying Soil: "At the beginning of your upkeep, exile a card from your graveyard." On turn 3 the graveyard is empty and
# nothing is exiled. Bot1 then casts a Lightning Bolt; on turn 5 the Bolt is the only card in the graveyard and is
# exiled, with nothing to choose. The threshold ability is not on the Soil (one card, not seven), so the Ornithopter
# that Bot2 bolts on turn 6 does not trigger it: the stack is empty and the Ornithopter stays in the graveyard.

